WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000
The duck walks alongside the divider.

00:00:12.480 --> 00:00:16.800
A new image arrives while the duck is still walking.

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:25.800
DeepSeek keeps walking straight, past the opening.

00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:33.000
The duck follows the divider toward the opening.

00:00:37.060 --> 00:00:44.400
DeepSeek sees open ground on the right and chooses it.

00:00:44.740 --> 00:00:49.400
7.68 seconds later, the right turn starts at the opening.

00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:52.900
The duck heads back toward the low rails.
